OL,3,GNEWSA'Parking costs mean our customers
OL,4,Aare going elsewhere'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Kate Ravilious, the senior Labour
OL,7,Fcouncillor in charge of transport,
OL,8,Fsaid: "The economic and footfall data
OL,9,Fshows York has seen a decrease in spend
OL,10,Fsince 2024, but there are multiple
OL,11,Ffactors feeding into this downturn."
